{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Recognize the marker only when it is a JSON field name.** This scanner does not track key/value position, so malformed raw data such as `{\"message\":\"__durable_execution_filesystem_serdes\":1}` is claimed as an envelope because the marker string is followed by a colon. A supported non-JSON delegate therefore never receives the payload. Inspect streaming JSON `FIELD_NAME` tokens at object depth one, and add a custom-delegate regression test with the marker in value position.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7oejTh","finding_digest":"2624261e26e8f58fcfa8144860630aad3e8e0a6ae8f1aec1491b33609903039c","finding_id":"arf_v1_eyscmhrg5d2y7t5icregayykvu","finding_key":"sdk/serde/filesystemserdes::parseenvelope::marker-substring-false-positive","identity_key":"sdk/serde/filesystemserdes::parseenvelope::marker-substring-false-positive","line":237,"observation_digest":"4e18daec2a1d1078cff0a9112fab0b92e585b94fb737d2d4cabccd61c1a03ba4","observation_id":"aro_v1_jymnv3bkduihrt7qveis7kylsl","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/FileSystemSerDes.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_eyscmhrg5d2y7t5icregayykvu","published_at":"2026-09-01T02:50:16Z","review_id":"arr_v1_re3xjejh3z55knk6ldmw634xvb","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"124b87c108ee0ef5343aa357fc275d12d7ee424e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":237,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":672},"record_id":"art_v1_3fhimyq3gux56dyon7hh53yxda","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T02:50:16Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
